{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/120101_175601.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/1fl0431.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お疲れさまあや"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前ねぇ家族や友達とばぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/9116.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じぃ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/9116.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たちと『たこ焼きパーティー』したの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/1159.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生地から作ったりしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/1159.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなかキレイに丸い形になりませんでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/8030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/8030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/8030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はたこ焼きのタコが嫌いなんで、タコ抜きを作りました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/1159.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通のタコは好きだケド、たこ焼きのタコはいまだに苦手で……食べれないんですよぉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/8030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/8030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔ねっ、まあやタコの上に乗ってるカツオが食べれなかったのぉ（カツオが動いて恐かったから）でも食べれるようになった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/1159.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャキーンwwwwまあや成長したなりwwww"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タコも食べれるように頑張るぞ〜ん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/0188.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めてねぇ家族や友達と過ごす大切さをしりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/1184.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑顔っていいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/1024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言葉っていいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/1024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/8119.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また皆とパーティーしたいなぁって思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/8119.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやが作ったたこ焼きの写真のせとくから見てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/1041.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、いつもいつも皆様の温かいコメント！凄く凄く嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/1041.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホントに皆様大好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/8155.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/0126.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/8006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/8007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのぉ…………次回のblogは面白いコトをかくといったのですが………"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分でハードルを上げすぎてしまいましてぇ……"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書くのが恥ずかしくなってしまいましてぇ……………………"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また今度ぉ……………………面白いコトかくとか何も言わずにぃ……………何気に書くことにしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんと申し訳ない……Sorry"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/0238.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回のblogは、いつも"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/1141.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあや"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/1141.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ストレートヘアーなのですが、まきがみに挑戦したんで、まきがみの写真のせまぁぁぁぁぁぁす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/0226.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でわでわここら辺で……………"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/17/0457.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"}],"source":"archive"}